# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
game: Radiant Silvergun (Japan)
gameid: T-32902G
system: saturn
---

# Scene index.
#   1 title, 2 option, 3/4 ranking, 5 opening, 6 ending roll,
#   7 STG00 (arcade mode only), 8-12 stages 1-5 under player control,
#   13-16 stages 1-4 replaying a recorded demo.
watch scene byte 0x0601CDC1
def playing scene in (7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12)

# Death count, one byte per player inside that player's record. It
# steps up on the frame the ship starts its explosion, which is well
# ahead of the respawn. A player who never joined never reaches it.
watch p1_deaths byte 0x0601CE02
watch p2_deaths byte 0x0601CEBE

# Death.
on p1_deaths increased by 1 while playing:
    pulse 1.0 800ms

on p2_deaths increased by 1 while playing:
    pulse 1.0 800ms player 2
